730e2646-0c4a-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&ceid=110103","author":["[[Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev]]"],"published":"2026-05-06","created":"2026-07-08","description":"Deputies at the Ada County Sheriff’s Office take home far smaller paychecks than other Treasure Valley police departments or similar cities in the Mountain West. Data obtained by BoiseDev through the Idaho Public Records Act found ACSO employees’ take-home pay ranked behind four other Treasure Valley departments and two others across the Mountain West region, […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},